  FAULT 1 (fatal): "pdfTeX error (font expansion): auto expansion is only possible with scalable
    fonts". Cause: microtype's font expansion + [T1]{fontenc} with the default CM fonts, which only
    exist as bitmaps at T1; the cover page's \fontsize{28} \sffamily was the trigger. Fixed by
    loading lmodern (scalable T1 CM) AND setting microtype to [protrusion=true,expansion=false].
    Either alone would do; both is belt-and-braces and costs nothing.
